      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹54.05 (vs ₹39.15 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹54.05 (up from ₹39.15 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹13.1b (up 19% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.12b (up 38% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.5% (up from 7.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 9% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 7% per year.",
