      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹51.61 (vs ₹46.66 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹51.61 (up from ₹46.66 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.08b (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.07b (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 18% (in line with 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 17% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 4% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
